# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is git-ignored and never bundled.
#
# Claude API key for Ask Splito / Search & Ask (decision 115, F-247).
# Read ONLY by the local AI proxy (scripts/ai-proxy, dev only), which calls Claude for the app.
# NEVER rename this to EXPO_PUBLIC_*: those are copied into the app's JavaScript and anyone could read them.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
